        "nobel_worthiness": "HPV virus-like-particle vaccines provide an exceptionally clear preventive route to major human cancers and have had broad public-health impact.",
        "attribution": "The three proposed laureates represent central discovery and translational contributions to the VLP vaccine concept.",
        "maturity": "The mechanism, efficacy, safety, and real-world preventive value have been extensively established over many years.",
