      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "GLP-1 physiology enabled a transformative therapeutic class for diabetes and obesity, with consequences across metabolic medicine.",
        "attribution": "Holst, Mojsov, and Drucker provide a coherent core for the physiological discovery and its medical development.",
        "maturity": "The clinical effects and medical uptake are substantial, and the underlying biology has long been tested.",
        "uncertainties": [
