        "nobel_worthiness": "Antisense correction of SMN2 splicing established a powerful molecularly targeted treatment for a formerly devastating genetic disease.",
        "attribution": "Krainer and Bennett form a compact and credible pairing spanning the splicing insight and antisense therapeutic platform.",
        "maturity": "Clinical benefit and durable translation of the strategy are well established.",
        "uncertainties": [
