        "Vijay G. Sankaran"
      ],
      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "BCL11A-mediated fetal-hemoglobin reactivation linked regulatory genetics to potentially curative treatment strategies for hemoglobin disorders.",
        "attribution": "Orkin, Sankaran, and Bauer provide a defensible core around the regulatory mechanism and its therapeutic exploitation.",
        "maturity": "Human genetic evidence, mechanistic work, and clinical therapeutic validation make the advance increasingly mature.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "The contribution of Swee Lay Thein and the division between fetal-hemoglobin genetics and BCL11A-specific discovery require close evaluation."
        ]
