        "nobel_worthiness": "Massively parallel DNA sequencing reshaped genome-scale biology, disease research, and clinical genomics through an enabling technological breakthrough.",
        "attribution": "The proposed laureates are identified with the key sequencing innovation, although development involved intertwined academic and industrial contributions.",
        "maturity": "Its centrality to modern biology and medicine is incontrovertible and sustained.",
